            {
              "span": 8,
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "AI Shakespeare (2023)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "'AI Shakespeare' is an art project and a body of research that delves into the notion of authorship and how one's work extends beyond oneself, influencing and inspiring countless other creations.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Out of one made-in-china Shakespeare bust, several new characters were born",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here",
                  "href": "https://littlemartians.substack.com/p/ai-shakespeare",
                  "external": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 3,
                  "html": "New Little Martians Blog! (2023)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "I created a Substack website for the Little Martians Universe. All the process and debates will be posted there now. This page will remain active, I just don’t update it as often. The first Substack post is called ‘<strong><em>Little Martians and the Human Imaginarium:</em></strong> <em>Tales from a future simulation</em>’ and explains how I came up with the concept and it evolved from Human Memorial to Human Imaginarium.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here",
                  "href": "https://littlemartians.substack.com/p/little-martians-and-the-human-imaginarium",
                  "external": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 3,
                  "html": "Little Martians at Mars 22 (2022)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "During Mars College 2022, I invited my fellow Martians to create their own “Little Martian” avatars. It started as a ceramics class I taught at the local ceramics studio in Bombay Beach, <a href=\"https://bbartsculture.org/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">BBAC</a>, where participants learned about clay, modeling techniques, bisque-firing, and glaze-firing. I presented the ceramic heads I’ve been creating for my own <a href=\"https://www.littlemartians.world/\">sci-fi universe project</a> as a reference, and encouraged people to freely experiment as much as they wanted as they sculpted their own heads.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here",
                  "href": "https://marscollege.substack.com/p/little-martians-at-mars-22",
                  "external": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
