            {
              "span": 8,
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Little Martians - Ceramic 3d AI beings (2022)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "Once upon a time, <strong>a god shaped clay into human form and breathed a soul into it.</strong> From Mesopotamia, to east Asia, to the ancient Americas, the Bible and the Qur’an, the legend of humanity’s creation from clay is a common tale. Clay/ceramics is one of the oldest technologies we have ever known.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "It's also key to our future. Cheap, easy to find, adaptable, high-temperature resistance, chemically stable, they’re very useful heat shields for space exploration.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "<strong>Could AI breathe life into clay based humans?</strong>",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here!",
                  "href": "https://mirror.xyz/0x0f6712c6ac4f02f47cA8b5cf200B224aE6fD8B69/Zj_We9-3dRx7DZatRKFWrqQxRbDczVgwLU41ZyojG-Y",
                  "external": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Phygital murals (2022)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "I've been interested in combining projection mapping and murals for years. I had the chance of creating installations in <a href=\"https://va2rosa.com/Ethnocomputing-Experiments\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>cultural centers</span></a>, galleries and <a href=\"https://va2rosa.com/Same-Nhandepa-exhibit\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>museums</span></a> with this approach, but it was always too tricky to do so in open space. Happily, <a href=\"https://mars.college/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Mars College</span></a> is a perfect space for this! In this year edition, I could give a far better development to a concept I've been ruminating since 2017, when I created a piece with <a href=\"https://www.wenqi.li/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Wenqi Li</span></a> for Babycastles in NYC. It was then called <a href=\"https://va2rosa.com/Infinity-Game\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Infinity Game</span></a>.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here",
                  "href": "https://mirror.xyz/0x0f6712c6ac4f02f47cA8b5cf200B224aE6fD8B69/66kZcHMYgh52cqQ0jcenIs04iB4AB_-2FnUziMQY7RE",
                  "external": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "A ceramic temple becomes a 3d scenario (2022)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "I've been playing quite a bit with my ceramic heads and their 3d scanned versions. I wrote two articles <a href=\"https://mars.college/2021/10/29/ceramics2.html\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>about the process of these pieces</span></a>. At some point, I decided it was time to expand this clay made universe. First, I had a request from Gene Kogan, who wanted a temple for <a href=\"https://abraham.ai/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Abraham</span></a>. Not a real big temple, but a metaverse one. So, I proposed a ceramic sculpture that we could 3d scan and build around it, in real life and in the digital world.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here",
                  "href": "https://mirror.xyz/0x0f6712c6ac4f02f47cA8b5cf200B224aE6fD8B69/slzAd3k-cTjg-5xuw8tCJox19nkV8sbm-s1XZYZK8nk",
                  "external": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Transforming my watercolours into AI (Style Transfer) animations (2022)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "This week, <a href=\"https://www.untitledfrontier.studio/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Untitled Frontier</a> minted a collection of NFTs that illustrate my story <a href=\"https://www.untitledfrontier.studio/blog/logged-universe-3-little-martians-amp-the-human-memorial-monument\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">\"Little Martians and the Human Memorial Monument\"</a>. The artworks come from a collaboration with <a href=\"https://twitter.com/genekogan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Gene Kogan</a>, who used his signature neural style transfer over my illustrations, creating abstract textures that are rendered as perfect loops. He also experimented with depth estimation and style transfer transitions, producing longer videos that don't loop. <a href=\"https://foundation.app/collection/lmhmm\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">All the works are available on Foundation</a>.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here",
                  "href": "https://mirror.xyz/0x0f6712c6ac4f02f47cA8b5cf200B224aE6fD8B69/RLu8NF1LmPUSYXOEuDDEhVkdoZ-EYffkG4FPO0v2flc",
                  "external": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
