            {
              "span": 8,
              "content": [
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Crafting the On-chain SVG Little Martians (2022)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "by Simon de la Rouviere",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "When Vanessa Rosa first showed me the real-world ceramics that helped inspire the story of “<a href=\"https://www.untitledfrontier.studio/blog/logged-universe-3-little-martians-amp-the-human-memorial-monument\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Little Martians &amp; The Human Memorial Monument</a>”, I knew this would be a fun challenge to create on-chain SVG versions of them. This article goes delves into how the on-chain Little Martians are crafted using SVG from code directly embedded in the smart contracts.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here",
                  "href": "https://www.untitledfrontier.studio/blog/crafting-the-on-chain-svg-little-martians",
                  "external": true
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "level": 2,
                  "html": "Using your own artwork to train an AI (2022)",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "html": "As mentioned in my last post, me and my partner <a href=\"https://twitter.com/genekogan\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Gene Kogan</span></a> have been experimenting with illustrating a short sci-fi story I’ve written and recently published with <a href=\"https://www.untitledfrontier.studio/blog/logged-universe-3-little-martians-amp-the-human-memorial-monument\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Untitled Frontier</span></a>. The story evolved from a project I started in 2020, the first time I went to Mars. Not so far as the planet Mars, but in a little part of the Sonoran desert where a bunch of friends created an art community/ R&amp;D lab we call <a href=\"https://mars.college/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\"><span>Mars</span></a>.",
                  "align": null,
                  "size": null
                },
                {
                  "type": "button",
                  "text": "Read it here",
                  "href": "https://mirror.xyz/0x0f6712c6ac4f02f47cA8b5cf200B224aE6fD8B69/n1nQnVBgnwy151gGvSp3dcxDhReELbWOIYqBWfRO5NM",
                  "external": true
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
